    "---\n",
    "## Part 1 — Sensor Drift Analysis & Visualization\n",
    "**Goal:** Show mathematically how sensor signal quality degrades over 36 months.\n",
    "This is the core problem for companies like SONATRACH — knowing *when* to replace sensors before they fail."
